上证综指下跌 1.59%，科创 50 下跌 1.50%。\n📊上证 50 下跌 0.42%，创业板指下跌 2.92%。\n📊沪深 300 下跌 1.23%，中证 500 下跌 3.02%。\n💰总成交额 1.65 万亿元人民币，环比上升 15.38%。\n\n🌏全区域避险情绪升温，AI 相关标的受创最重，中国市场也不例外。\n📉上证综指盘中一度下跌","url":"https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2110663264132849756"},{"author_id":"1996551578187436033","created_at":"2026-10-16T04:13:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110947169012416534"],"id":"2110947169012416534","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":479,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"📊 开盘速报 | 10/16 全线高开缩量反弹：军工单边爆发，PCB退潮换座位\n\n▪️ 三大指数","url":"https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2110947169012416534"},{"author_id":"2105582591122583552","created_at":"2026-10-16T00:44:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110894722499907726"],"id":"2110894722499907726","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":108,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"瑞银：现在是买入A股的好时机吗？瑞银在10月14日发布《中国股票策略：现在是买入A股的好时机吗？》。\n\n报告指出，近期A股回调主要因科技板块拥挤仓位平仓，但下行风险有限，盈利仍在上行周期。以下内容整理自该报告。\n\n1、近期回调与7月不同","url":"https://x.com/HDchengzhu/status/2110894722499907726"},{"author_id":"1913965111045398528","created_at":"2026-10-15T22:31:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110861136421962161"],"id":"2110861136421962161","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":6226,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"再来说说宽基ETF,全市场宽基ETF一天吃掉1139亿，是今年少见的量级。要知道今年前10个月的日常行情里，全市场宽基ETF的单日总成交额基本都维持在300亿到500亿的区间，就算是今年一季度大家集体喊着抄底的阶段性小反弹行情里，全市场宽基ETF单日总流入的最高纪录也才不到720亿，这次直接冲到1139亿的规模","url":"https://x.com/m0sHown5gS16742/status/2110861136421962161"},{"author_id":"2108191189019381760","created_at":"2026-10-16T01:50:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110911190721589652"],"id":"2110911190721589652","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":11376,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":6},"text":"瑞银：现在是买入A股的好时机吗？\n\n瑞银在10月14日发布《中国股票策略：现在是买入A股的好时机吗？》。报告指出，近期A股回调主要因科技板块拥挤仓位平仓，但下行风险有限，盈利仍在上行周期。以下内容整理自该报告。\n\n1、近期回调与7月不同","url":"https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2110911190721589652"},{"author_id":"1685620377941364736","created_at":"2026-10-15T12:25:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110708683097411906"],"id":"2110708683097411906","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":176,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"10月份就是磨底了，11月12月震荡向上。\n#宽基ETF放量\n沪深300ETF易方达（510310）成交约194.13亿元（创今年1月以来天量，环比暴增，尾盘半小时大量成交）。\n科创50ETF华夏、创业板ETF易方达均突破100亿元（为8月19日以来首次）。\n沪深300系列ETF合计成交额约301.24亿元，环比大增约366%。","url":"https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2110708683097411906"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110931296621105152"]},"author_id":"477220985","created_at":"2026-10-16T03:10:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110931435532284292"],"id":"2110931435532284292","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":210,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"A股最近跌得人不太想看盘，今天盘中总算反弹了一下。现在能买了吗？瑞银刚好写了份报告讨论这事👀\n\n瑞银10月14日的报告认为，这轮回调主要是此前扎堆买科技股的资金在撤退。科技板块成交额占A股的比重，已从7月高点的49.7%降至37.2%。 https://t.co/sIz9QaQlnR","url":"https://x.com/chaoxiangooo/status/2110931435532284292"},{"author_id":"1871688008123990016","created_at":"2026-10-16T07:41:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110999490006225245"],"id":"2110999490006225245","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":36,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"上证50成交额超50亿\n沪深300成交额超160亿\n\n昨天神秘资金抄底科创50，今天抄底传统红利，是不是底部真的来了呢。","url":"https://x.com/LucasZ1031/status/2110999490006225245"},{"author_id":"1502253517737586691","created_at":"2026-10-15T01:50:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110548714125181143"],"id":"2110548714125181143","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":946,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"A股大幅低开！\n\n受昨晚美国CPI超预期冲击，三大指数全线低开，创业板开盘跌幅超过3%。\n\n算力、PCB、存储芯片集体重挫，直接承接隔夜美股半导体暴跌的情绪。\n\n盘面反差：煤炭、油气等高股息板块逆势抗跌，资金开盘直接涌向防御资产避险。","url":"https://x.com/aystxdlzfhj/status/2110548714125181143"},{"author_id":"1484783062772695040","created_at":"2026-10-15T08:52:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110654943833075976"],"id":"2110654943833075976","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":83,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"沪深300ETF易方达（510310）今天成交了194亿，是今年1月28日以来最大的一天，而它整个上午只成交了6亿多。","url":"https://x.com/MartynZheng/status/2110654943833075976"}],"includes":{"media":[{"media_key":"3_2110931296621105152","type":"photo"}],"users":[{"id":"2108191189019381760","name":"2030FY","username":"2030FY_X"},{"id":"1996551578187436033","name":"人类股市观察家","username":"YoooJJ8cm"},{"id":"1128198342859563008","name":"小明","username":"ming69621583"},{"id":"73251735","name":"Nolan（follow back）","username":"Blympie"},{"id":"857945237104111618","name":"财哥","username":"xuyuinfo5"},{"id":"997722661844287488","name":"🇨🇳 大策复盘","username":"dacefupan"},{"id":"1896761185938345984","name":"土三哥观察分享","username":"haotianche21370"},{"id":"967721109851385856","name":"大曦","username":"ansonze20181"},{"id":"1972218614473543685","name":"ChangLiu","username":"hdl48"},{"id":"2035018650965745664","name":"策研社","username":"wolf200131313"},{"id":"1813570093181194240","name":"大猫调研信息","username":"dmjk001"},{"id":"2105582591122583552","name":"混沌城主","username":"HDchengzhu"},{"id":"1913965111045398528","name":"郭","username":"m0sHown5gS16742"},{"id":"1685620377941364736","name":"万倍基哥","username":"zhishuzengzhang"},{"id":"477220985","name":"潮向研究","username":"chaoxiangooo"},{"id":"1871688008123990016","name":"Lucas","username":"LucasZ1031"},{"id":"1502253517737586691","name":"大道至简｜全球资产配置","username":"aystxdlzfhj"},{"id":"1484783062772695040","name":"笔飞","username":"MartynZheng"}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2111101532548800681","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlvkch0buw5gser0ynvs2zto6sn1","oldest_id":"2110548714125181143","result_count":25}}